    <div class="content-box step-card">
        <span class="step-pill">Step 1</span>
        <h2 class="content-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen-button"></i> Launch MiniPhone OS</h2>
        <p>You have been given access to a simulated smartphone running <strong>MiniPhone OS</strong>. Your job is to investigate the apps installed on it and find out exactly what data they are trying to collect about you.</p>

        <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Open the simulation and go to the <strong>Messages</strong> app.</li>
            <li>Follow the missions in the messages.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="activity-toolbar no-print" style="margin: 1rem 0 0; justify-content: flex-start;">
