    <div class="content-box step-card">
        <span class="step-pill">Step 2</span>
        <h2 class="content-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-clipboard-list"></i> Create Your Investigation Log</h2>
        <p>Before you start, draw this table in your exercise book. You will fill it in as you explore each app.</p>

